<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle market not tested- USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle market not tested- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Friday's close, USDA said. Reported sales for Mon - None.  Week to Date - 1,400</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-872))</p>
